    <string name="ad_explanation_banner_title">🔍 Why Ads?</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_banner_description">Learn why you see ads and how to remove them. Help us improve — share your ideas!</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_banner_button">Learn More</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_screen_title">About Ads</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_greeting">Dear user! 👋</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_paragraph_1">You may have noticed ads in the app. We understand it can be untimely, and we appreciate your patience. We want to honestly explain why we can\'t do without it for now.</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_paragraph_2">Right now, we don\'t have paid subscriptions. Ads are the only way that helps the project exist and grow. Thanks to them, we pay for servers and the team\'s work.</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_paragraph_3">And ahead of us are big and ambitious goals:</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_ai_integration">🚀 AI integration for new smart features.</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_cloud_storage">☁️ Reliable cloud storage for your data.</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_and_more">And much more that will make the app more convenient.</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_paragraph_4">Every ad you watch is a small brick in building these features.</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_paragraph_5">We\'re very grateful for your understanding. If you can and want to — please leave a good review in the app store. It incredibly helps us grow and reach new people. But we absolutely don\'t insist — only if you feel like supporting us.</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_telegram_header">💬 Join our Telegram chat!</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_telegram_what_you_can_do">There you can:\n— Suggest your improvement idea.\n— Report a bug (we fix them very fast).\n— Be the first to know news and follow the project development.</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_go_to_telegram_button">Go to Telegram</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_close_button">Close</string>
    <string name="ad_explanation_finish">Thank you for being with us. Together we\'ll make this project really cool.</string>
