    <string name="manual_ai_title">How to create a test using a neural network?</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_info_one">The Tutor mobile app does not have direct integration with neural networks. This allows us to remain free for all users.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_info_two">However, you can easily use any popular neural network (e.g., DeepSeek, ChatGPT) to create a test and then upload it to the Tutor app. It\'s absolutely free.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_move">Brief video tutorial:</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_move_btn">Watch Video Tutorial</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_title">Step-by-step instructions:</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_first">1. Prepare a prompt (template)</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_first_description">Copy a special prompt from the Tutor app. This template will tell the neural network the correct format for generating a test.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_first_btn_first">Copy prompt for file</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_first_btn_second">Copy prompt for links</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_second">2. Generate a test in a neural network</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_second_description">Go to any convenient neural network. Our team recommends DeepSeek — it handles this task excellently.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_second_btn">Go to DeepSeek</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_second_description_two">• Paste the copied prompt into the neural network chat.\n• Add material: attach a text file (.txt, .doc) or provide a link to a website/article to create the test from.\n• Copy the finished test generated by the neural network.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three">3. Upload the test to the Tutor app</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three_description_first">Return to the Tutor app in the test creation section. Paste the copied test text from the clipboard.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three_btn_first">Paste test from clipboard</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three_description_second">Or upload a file: if the neural network saved the test to a .json file, simply select it from your device memory.</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_step_three_btn_second">Select File</string>
    <string name="manual_ai_finish">Done! The test is created and ready to use</string>

